    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLocated in the townland of Breaghva, just over 2km from Kilrush town, this 0.33 hectare (0.85 acre) site under folio numberFolio: CE9072F. is being offered for sale subject to planning permission, with local needs restrictions applying.\n\nThe large rectangular site is situated on a quiet country road just off the R483 KilrushCooraclare road. The land elevates from the roadside, offering an elevated setting with countryside views.\n\nKilrush town offers a wide range of amenities, including primary and secondary schools, supermarkets, shops, cafés, restaurants and sporting facilities. The nearby Kilrush Marina, Cappa Pier, Vandeleur Walled Garden and the wider West Clare coastline provide excellent recreational opportunities.\n\nDirections: From Kilrush, take the R483 towards Cooraclare and turn left at the second junction. Continue along this road for approximately 500 metres. The site is on the left-hand side, approximately 40 metres beyond Eircode V15 N230.\n\nViewing strictly by prior appointment with sole selling agents. PSL 002295."
      },
